+*   **Scaling:** Component reusability and multi-core layout allow users to choose required functions, simplifying layout and enabling scalability [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Strengths:** Real-time performance, continuous hardware-software communication, interactive user interface, simplified layout through component reusability [S1, unofficial].
